{"server":"tw","storyId":"act12side_level_act12side_04_beg","groupId":"act12side","stageId":"act12side_st02","title":"鐵人三項","storyCode":"DH-4","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"baaca9c0e7d421ee7e10993f9ebbb9a4423931e4e83ac5e35f0ee4a64c8a1fc0","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，先來一點音樂！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，經過一天的等待，我們即將迎來大獎賽的第二輪比賽——鐵人三項！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"20_I02_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"比賽規則十分簡單，先是跑步，再是騎行，最後是游泳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妨礙他人？沒有問題！只要隊伍中有一個人抵達終點就算出線！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"抄近道是被允許的，但是要當心那埋伏在巷道裡的傢伙！他們可不會輕易讓你通過！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，抵達終點的人，如果沒有通過騎行和游泳的兩個檢查點的話，成績是不被認可的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說，選手們可以在比賽開始後轉身就跳入海中游上游輪，但那只會讓你成為全城的笑柄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是個富豪，近地飛行器也是個可選項！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果不討好觀眾的話，可是有可能被投票出局的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"另外，由於第一輪出線的隊伍是十五支，加上一支透過觀眾投票復活的隊伍，第一輪一共出線十六支隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因此，第二輪的出線數量將是八支。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最先抵達游輪的八支隊伍將獲得出線的權利！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，讓我們接下來有請十六支參賽隊伍登場！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好漂亮的海......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來這座城市果然沒白來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就在這裡坐下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不然我還是回去吧，會給這裡的其他人添麻煩的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別太在意。這座城市好像不太在乎感染者問題的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然很明顯，這並不是因為他們開明，而是他們不在乎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，有蘇蘇洛跟著，不會有問題的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。艾雅法拉小姐的病症我心裡有數。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實你與其擔心給別人添麻煩，更應該擔心的是自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比其他人都要更加久居室內，這不僅對身體不好，對精神衛生也有影響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這也是這一次我作為醫生贊成將艾雅法拉小姐你帶到這裡來的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人都應該擁有享受陽光的權利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然博士那邊也是遇到了麻煩，但是隔著螢幕聽說他們在度假那叫什麼事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們艾雅法拉也該有個休假才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，我是自願做地質研究的，而且要是耽誤大家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你就別操心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們來這邊也是有正當理由的，羅德島想要在這座城市設立辦事處，一直沒有得到這座城市市長的同意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米婭讓我們來再當一次說客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你就安心在這裡享受比賽節目吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，紅呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她好像不打算出來，一個人不知道哪裡去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，這傢伙出任務以來就是這個樣子，我也習慣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，快看，來了來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"讓我們歡迎，鼠膽龍威隊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是分頭行動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鐵人三項賽程很長，各做各的很容易失去聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他隊伍裡除了單獨分出人來妨礙其他隊伍，基本上都是共同行動的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩位要是沒有類似的想法我還是建議一起行動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒意見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也可以。動手的時候別妨礙我就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陳","speakerId":"avg_1013_spchen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原話奉還。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是沒想到，一開始看電視我還以為看錯了，沒想到陳也來到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來她也在度假中，等比賽結束後，我們去和她打個招呼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾雅法拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_190_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"鑄鐵","speakerId":"avg_npc_206_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，你們先看，我去給你們買點吃的，你們就在這裡不要隨意走動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蘇蘇洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_199_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"以上就是所有十六支隊伍的介紹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"和第一輪一樣，為了讓觀眾們也享受到參與比賽的樂趣，我們為觀眾們也準備了豐富多彩的投注競猜項目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"各位觀眾在官方網站上登入自己的資訊後可以為自己賺一筆外快！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"具體操作流程請參照官方發佈的比賽指南。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"第二輪比賽中，我們的嘉賓配置將有所變化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"潘喬先生為了準備第三輪比賽已經先一步前往了遊輪上，他將透過視訊連線的方式和觀眾們對話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，參賽選手們已經都來到了預備線上，請坎黛拉女士來為我們拉響第二輪的禮炮吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坎黛拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_198_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玩得高興點，年輕人們。我宣佈——第二輪比賽，正式開始！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G03"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃內斯托","speakerId":"avg_486_espumo_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來我們又被盯上了，兩位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_196_1","isRemote":false,"text":"速戰速決。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
